+Decisions made during implementation:
+- Unprefixed (pre-final) BIP-322 signatures are rejected; claims accept BIP-322 simple / full or a legacy signed message for P2PKH
+- Time-locked ownership proofs are not accepted
+- Every coinbase carries the tag `coin-series` after the height, so no transaction id on these chains can equal a Bitcoin transaction id
+- Claim transactions use version `0x434C4D31`, up to 500 inputs, proofs up to 10,000 bytes
+
